---
// Astroplate pack (#1653): mission pillars — reframed from the original's alternating
// image/feature rows as three short statements (mission, who's served, how the org works).
// Placeholder copy is generic on purpose; the owner edits it in the app like any other
// page content.
---

<section class="ap-mission" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <div class="ap-mission-intro">
    <p class="ap-eyebrow">Our mission</p>
    <h2 id="mission-heading">Why this organization exists</h2>
    <p>Describe the change you're working toward and who benefits from it.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="ap-pillar-list">
    <li>
      <h3>Who we serve</h3>
      <p>Name the people, place, or cause at the center of this work.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>How we work</h3>
      <p>Explain the programs, events, or day-to-day work that carries out the mission.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>What's next</h3>
      <p>Point at the goal, campaign, or milestone the community is building toward.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
